From f1485e26e097e51991a1c1ed909cd0bb61405dbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 19:58:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): explain the remaining verified dialects

Add bounded Explain comments to eight posts. Keep machine EDM codes
unexplained. Pin the named Heidenhain and Sodick refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Fixes #1389
